      "claim": "High-F anilide contexts (leflunomide, teriflunomide) are less transferable to the query because they are much smaller, less lipophilic, and in the case of teriflunomide ionized at physiological pH, whereas the query is neutral with logP 6.86 and a long conjugated polyene.",
